      <h1>WhatsApp Usernames Feature: How to Chat Without Sharing Your Phone Number (2026)</h1>
      <div class="article-meta">
        <span>By <a href="/about" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;">Nazim · Social Ninja's</a></span><span>·</span><span>Sep 22, 2026</span><span>·</span><span>5 min read</span>
      </div>
      <p class="article-intro">In the biggest architectural shift since its inception, WhatsApp has rolled out <strong>Usernames</strong>. Users and businesses can now communicate without revealing their private phone numbers. Here is everything you need to know about setting up your username, protecting your privacy, and updating your marketing links.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
